path: /
title: The School Manager: school management software for Pakistan
description: School management software for Pakistani private schools. One parent pays once for all their children, and you see what was owed. From Rs 2,000 a month.
schema: org software
priority: 1.0
changefreq: weekly
---
<header class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="wrap hero__grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Built for Pakistani schools</span>
      <h1>Your entire school.<br><em>One simple dashboard.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Replace messy registers and spreadsheets. Manage fees, track attendance, and print result cards seamlessly, even when the internet goes down.
      </p>
      <div class="hero__cta">
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/pricing" data-app="signup">Start 14 day free trial</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="/fee-management">See how fees work</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero__note">✓ No card required &nbsp; ✓ Set up in an afternoon &nbsp; ✓ Your data stays yours</p>
      <p id="signup-closed" hidden class="hero__note">
        We are at capacity this month. Get in touch and we will put you next in line.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="app">
      <div class="app__body">
        <div class="app__side" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="app__brand">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <rect width="24" height="24" rx="6" fill="#4F46E5"/>
              <g fill="#fff"><circle cx="12" cy="7.5" r="1.4"/><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.5 12.5h13v6h-13zm2.5 1.5h8v1h-8zm0 2h8v1h-8z"/></g>
            </svg>
            Al-Noor School
          </div>
          <div class="app__nav">
            <span>Dashboard</span>
            <span>Admissions</span>
            <span>Students</span>
            <span>Attendance</span>
            <span class="on">Fees</span>
            <span>Exams</span>
            <span>Accounts</span>
            <span>Reports</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="app__main">
          <div class="app__tiles">
            <div class="tile"><span>Active Students</span><b class="tnum">486</b></div>
            <div class="tile tile--money"><span>Collected Today</span><b class="tnum">Rs 84,500</b></div>
            <div class="tile tile--due"><span>Outstanding</span><b class="tnum">Rs 312,000</b></div>
          </div>
          <div class="app__rows">
            <div class="arow"><b>Muhammad Aslam</b><span class="muted">3 children</span></div>
            <div class="arow"><span>Ahmed, Class 5</span><span class="pill pill--paid">Paid</span></div>
            <div class="arow"><span>Fatima, Class 3</span><span class="pill pill--paid">Paid</span></div>
            <div class="arow"><span>Bilal, Play Group</span><span class="pill pill--due">Rs 1,200 due</span></div>
            <div class="arow"><b>One receipt</b><b class="tnum">Rs 5,800</b></div>
          </div>
          <div class="chart" aria-hidden="true">
            <i style="height:44%"></i><i style="height:62%"></i><i style="height:53%"></i>
            <i style="height:78%"></i><i style="height:66%"></i><i style="height:88%"></i>
            <i style="height:72%"></i><i style="height:96%"></i>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="trust reveal">
  <div class="wrap trust__in">
    <div class="trust__cell">
      <span class="trust__k">From</span>
      <span class="trust__v"><b id="lead-price">Rs 2,000</b> <small>a month</small></span>
    </div>
    <div class="trust__cell">
      <span class="trust__k">Trial</span>
      <span class="trust__v">14 days <small>no card</small></span>
    </div>
    <div class="trust__cell">
      <span class="trust__k">Modules</span>
      <span class="trust__v">All included <small>every plan</small></span>
    </div>
    <div class="trust__cell">
      <span class="trust__k">Runs on</span>
      <span class="trust__v">Any browser <small>no install</small></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section" id="what">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal">WHAT IT DOES</span>
    <h2 class="reveal">The whole school, not just the fee counter</h2>
    <p class="lede reveal" style="margin-top:14px">
      One price. Every module. No add-ons to buy later.
    </p>
    <div class="grid grid--3" style="margin-top:48px">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Fees (Green/Money) -->
      <a class="card card--link" href="/fee-management">
        <div class="card__icon" style="background: var(--money-50); color: var(--money-700);">
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v12m-3-2.818l.879.659c1.171.879 3.07.879 4.242 0 1.172-.879 1.172-2.303 0-3.182C13.536 12.219 12.768 12 12 12c-.725 0-1.45-.22-2.003-.659-1.106-.879-1.106-2.303 0-3.182s2.9-.879 4.006 0l.415.33M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Fees and challans</h3>
        <p>One parent pays once for all their children. Monthly challans, arrears carried forward, partial payments, fines, approved discounts, and a receipt number that cannot skip.</p>
        <span class="card__more">How fee collection works</span>
      </a>

      <!-- Card 2: Attendance (Brand Blue) -->
      <a class="card card--link" href="/attendance">
        <div class="card__icon">
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Attendance</h3>
        <p>A daily register per class, marked from a phone in the classroom, that keeps working when the internet does not. Finalise, lock, and print the monthly sheet.</p>
        <span class="card__more">How attendance works</span>
      </a>

      <!-- Card 3: Exams (Brand Blue) -->
      <a class="card card--link" href="/exams-and-results">
        <div class="card__icon">
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Exams and result cards</h3>
        <p>Marks per paper, practicals and weightage, grades computed on your own scale, then printed result cards, tabulation sheets and class positions.</p>
        <span class="card__more">How exams work</span>
      </a>

      <!-- Card 4: Accounts (Amber/Due) -->
      <a class="card card--link" href="/accounts">
        <div class="card__icon" style="background: var(--due-50); color: var(--due-800);">
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 17v-2m3 2v-4m3 4v-6m2 10H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Accounts and payroll</h3>
        <p>An expense ledger with categories, other income, a day book, staff salaries, and the monthly profit that follows from all of it.</p>
        <span class="card__more">How the accounts work</span>
      </a>

      <!-- Card 5: Parent Portal (Cyan/Accent) -->
      <a class="card card--link" href="/parent-portal">
        <div class="card__icon card__icon--accent">
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 18h.01M8 21h8a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H8a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Parent portal</h3>
        <p>Parents sign in on their own phone and see their own children only: balance, every receipt, attendance day by day, and results once you publish them.</p>
        <span class="card__more">How the portal works</span>
      </a>

      <!-- Card 6: Rest of it (Gray/Neutral) -->
      <div class="card reveal"> 
        <div class="card__icon" style="background: var(--bg-3); color: var(--ink-2);">
          <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM14 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM4 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2zM14 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>And the rest of it</h3>
        <p>Admissions with automatic GR numbers and sibling linking. Staff records and teacher logins. Leaving, character and bonafide certificates on tracked serial registers. Student and staff ID cards. Year end rollover for the whole school in one pass.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================================================================ records ===-->
<section class="section section--tint" id="records">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Your records</span>
      <h2>Your records leave with you</h2>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:12px">
        Export everything you have entered, at any time, in a plain readable
        format, including on the day you decide to leave. There is no lock in
        and no fee for your own data.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:16px">
        And nothing is ever quietly removed. A wrong entry is corrected by a
        reversal, so both lines stay in the record with a reason and a name. If
        somebody asks in two years why a receipt was cancelled, the answer is
        still there.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:20px">
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/faq">Read the questions principals ask</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="panel__head">
        <span class="panel__title">Audit trail</span>
        <span class="panel__sub">Muhammad Aslam</span>
      </div>
      <div class="app__rows" style="border:0;border-radius:0">
        <div class="arow"><span>Receipt 1041<br><small>Asif Mehmood, class 5</small></span><b>Rs 1,700</b></div>
        <div class="arow"><span>Reversal of 1041<br><small>Wrong pupil, entered 09:12</small></span><b>(Rs 1,700)</b></div>
        <div class="arow"><span>Posted to the wrong child</span><span class="pill pill--paid">Net Rs 0</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel__foot">
        Neither line is struck out, because neither line happened by accident. This
        is what answers the question two years later.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="testimonial-band reveal">
      <p class="testimonial-quote">
        "It cut our month-end fee reconciliation from three days of paperwork and arguments down to a fifteen-minute coffee break. It just works."
      </p>
      <div class="testimonial-author">
        Ahmad R.
        <span>Principal, Private School</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ==================================================================== cta ===-->
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta reveal"> S
      <h2>Try it with one class first</h2>
      <p>
        Fourteen days, no card, no commitment. Put one class in, run a month's
        challans, and see whether the numbers agree with your register.
      </p>
      <div class="cta__row">
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/pricing" data-app="signup">Start your free trial</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="/contact">Talk to a person first</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
